// Real terminal captures: crabigator sessions run in tmux and captured with
// `tmux capture-pane -e`, November 4, 2026. Pairing codes are blanked and a run of
// empty rows collapses to one; nothing else is simulated. Each status bar draws
// its flow cells as SVG with the 2x4 masks flow's desktop renderer uses, so the
// scene's blocks meet at any line height. A working session's bar carries twelve
// consecutive captures of its scene, a quarter second apart, which CSS cycles.
// Rows marked `stream` arrive one by one, first on the desktop and then the phone.
import type { SessionValues } from './app-modules';

